| `check_H` project facts | Refuses a `config/project.json` fact the tree contradicts, such as a stack, a transport or `layers.app`, and a `layers.frontend.root` that resolves outside the project. | `make check` | [`layers.app`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`frontend`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | `models.default` and `runtimes.default` are checked for shape only, not against the registry constants. A missing manifest is an error. Frontend confinement judges the path when the check runs; a link swapped later is not caught. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
